  kind: 9
  description: 'A StarTram: an evacuated maglev tube 1 km along the desert floor, then rising in a long curve to leave Ochre''s thin air 900 m up, held up magnetically and tethered down. Capsules leave its mouth at 1.5 km/s.'
  bodyRadius: 400
  arrivalDistance: 2600
  mapColor: {r: 0.7, g: 0.92, b: 0.78, a: 1}
  orbitParent: {fileID: 1249114216}
